{"seq":1,"slug":"cpu-memory-profiling","title":"CPU 与内存 Profiling","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/debugging-troubleshooting/performance-profiling/cpu-memory-profiling","wordCount":597,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"cpu-与内存-profiling\">CPU 与内存 Profiling</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>CPU 和内存 Profiling 是量化分析程序运行时资源消耗的核心技术。CPU Profiling 回答&quot;程序把时间花在了哪些函数上&quot;，内存 Profiling 回答&quot;程序的内存被什么对象占用&quot;。掌握这两种分析技术是性能优化的基础——没有数据支撑的优化都是盲目猜测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"profiling-的两种模式\">Profiling 的两种模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P[&quot;Profiling 方式&quot;] --&gt; S[&quot;采样型 Sampling&quot;]&#10;    P --&gt; I[&quot;插桩型 Instrumentation&quot;]&#10;&#10;    S --&gt; S1[&quot;定期中断, 记录当前调用栈&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; S2[&quot;低开销 1-5%, 统计近似&quot;]&#10;    S --&gt; S3[&quot;适合生产环境&quot;]&#10;&#10;    I --&gt; I1[&quot;在函数入口/出口插入计时代码&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; I2[&quot;高开销 10-100%, 精确计时&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; I3[&quot;适合开发环境&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    P[\"Profiling 方式\"] --&gt; S[\"采样型 Sampling\"]\n    P --&gt; I[\"插桩型 Instrumentation\"]\n\n    S --&gt; S1[\"定期中断, 记录当前调用栈\"]\n    S --&gt; S2[\"低开销 1-5%, 统计近似\"]\n    S --&gt; S3[\"适合生产环境\"]\n\n    I --&gt; I1[\"在函数入口/出口插入计时代码\"]\n    I --&gt; I2[\"高开销 10-100%, 精确计时\"]\n    I --&gt; I3[\"适合开发环境\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>采样型</th>\n<th>插桩型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原理</td>\n<td>定时器中断采集调用栈</td>\n<td>代码注入计时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开销</td>\n<td>1-5%</td>\n<td>10-100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度</td>\n<td>统计近似</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产可用</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>通常不是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代表工具</td>\n<td>perf, pprof, async-profiler</td>\n<td>gprof, callgrind</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"cpu-profiling-工作原理\">CPU Profiling 工作原理</h3><p>采样型 CPU profiler 的工作流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"1. 以固定频率（如 99Hz）发送信号中断程序&#10;2. 在中断处理中记录当前线程的完整调用栈&#10;3. 运行一段时间后收集所有样本&#10;4. 统计每个函数出现在栈顶的次数 → CPU 时间占比&#10;5. 统计每个函数出现在栈中的次数 → 含子调用的总时间\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>1. 以固定频率（如 99Hz）发送信号中断程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. 在中断处理中记录当前线程的完整调用栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. 运行一段时间后收集所有样本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. 统计每个函数出现在栈顶的次数 → CPU 时间占比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>5. 统计每个函数出现在栈中的次数 → 含子调用的总时间</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Linux perf: 系统级 CPU profiling&#10;perf record -F 99 -p $(pidof myapp) -g -- sleep 30&#10;# -F 99: 采样频率 99Hz（避免与系统时钟对齐）&#10;# -p: 目标进程&#10;# -g: 记录调用栈&#10;&#10;perf report --stdio  # 文本报告&#10;perf script &gt; out.perf  # 导出用于火焰图\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Linux perf: 系统级 CPU profiling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 99</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pidof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> myapp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">-g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># -F 99: 采样频率 99Hz（避免与系统时钟对齐）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># -p: 目标进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># -g: 记录调用栈</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> report</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --stdio</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 文本报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> out.perf</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 导出用于火焰图</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go: 内置 pprof CPU profiling&#10;import (&#10;    &quot;os&quot;&#10;    &quot;runtime/pprof&quot;&#10;)&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10;    // 开始 CPU profile&#10;    f, _ := os.Create(&quot;cpu.prof&quot;)&#10;    pprof.StartCPUProfile(f)&#10;    defer pprof.StopCPUProfile()&#10;&#10;    // ... 程序逻辑 ...&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 或通过 HTTP 端点动态采集&#10;import _ &quot;net/http/pprof&quot;&#10;// GET /debug/pprof/profile?seconds=30\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go: 内置 pprof CPU profiling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">os</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runtime/pprof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 开始 CPU profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    f, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> os.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cpu.prof\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pprof.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StartCPUProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    defer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pprof.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">StopCPUProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // ... 程序逻辑 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 或通过 HTTP 端点动态采集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">net/http/pprof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// GET /debug/pprof/profile?seconds=30</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Python: cProfile 和 py-spy&#10;import cProfile&#10;import pstats&#10;&#10;# 方式 1: cProfile（插桩型，有一定开销）&#10;profiler = cProfile.Profile()&#10;profiler.enable()&#10;result = expensive_function()&#10;profiler.disable()&#10;&#10;stats = pstats.Stats(profiler)&#10;stats.sort_stats(&#39;cumulative&#39;)&#10;stats.print_stats(20)  # 打印 top 20 函数&#10;&#10;# 方式 2: py-spy（采样型，生产可用）&#10;# pip install py-spy&#10;# py-spy record -o profile.svg --pid 12345&#10;# py-spy top --pid 12345  # 实时 top 视图\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Python: cProfile 和 py-spy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cProfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pstats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方式 1: cProfile（插桩型，有一定开销）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">profiler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cProfile.Profile()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">profiler.enable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expensive_function()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">profiler.disable()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pstats.Stats(profiler)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stats.sort_stats(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cumulative'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stats.print_stats(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 打印 top 20 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 方式 2: py-spy（采样型，生产可用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># pip install py-spy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># py-spy record -o profile.svg --pid 12345</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># py-spy top --pid 12345  # 实时 top 视图</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"内存-profiling-技术\">内存 Profiling 技术</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Go: Heap profiling&#10;import &quot;runtime/pprof&quot;&#10;&#10;func analyzeMemory() {&#10;    // 获取当前 heap profile&#10;    f, _ := os.Create(&quot;mem.prof&quot;)&#10;    runtime.GC()  // 先 GC 以获得准确快照&#10;    pprof.WriteHeapProfile(f)&#10;    f.Close()&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 分析命令&#10;// go tool pprof mem.prof&#10;// (pprof) top          → 内存占用最大的函数&#10;// (pprof) list funcName → 逐行内存分配&#10;// (pprof) web          → 可视化调用图\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go: Heap profiling</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runtime/pprof</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyzeMemory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 获取当前 heap profile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    f, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> os.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mem.prof\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    runtime.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 先 GC 以获得准确快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    pprof.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WriteHeapProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    f.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 分析命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// go tool pprof mem.prof</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (pprof) top          → 内存占用最大的函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (pprof) list funcName → 逐行内存分配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// (pprof) web          → 可视化调用图</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Java: JVM 内存分析&#10;// 方式 1: jmap + jhat&#10;// jmap -dump:format=b,file=heap.hprof &lt;pid&gt;&#10;// jhat heap.hprof  → 浏览器查看&#10;&#10;// 方式 2: async-profiler (推荐, 低开销)&#10;// ./asprof -e alloc -d 30 -f alloc.jfr &lt;pid&gt;&#10;// 采集 30 秒内存分配热点&#10;&#10;// 方式 3: JFR (Java Flight Recorder)&#10;// -XX:StartFlightRecording=duration=60s,filename=recording.jfr\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"c